{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":499603,"name":"Jason L","username":"FloridaJay","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/f/ce73a5/{size}.png","created_at":"2026-09-24T02:32:05.398Z","cooked":"\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-499603-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-499603-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eWhere does the bug appear (feature/product)?\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-499603-describe-the-bug-2\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-499603-describe-the-bug-2\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDescribe the Bug\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot personal finance and client sync are broken.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003col\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFinance/Plaid Marketplace plugin is gone (old id 63408931; \u003ca href=\"http://cursor.com/marketplace/cursor/finance\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"\u003ecursor.com/marketplace/cursor/finance\u003c/a\u003e = Plugin Not Found). GitHub still has the finance plugin pointing at \u003ca href=\"https://connectors-gateway.grok.com/gateway/v1/finance/mcp\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"\u003ehttps://connectors-gateway.grok.com/gateway/v1/finance/mcp\u003c/a\u003e, but the live listing is delisted.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFinance briefly installed earlier but never became a usable MCP — no auth/connect card, no Plaid Link.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAddMcpServer with that official finance gateway said “Added finance,” but no finance server ever appeared in GetMcpServerStatus (still only Slack / Outlook / Agentmail / GitHub).\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBank website fallback failed (Citi returned “temporary delays” after login). Prefer Plaid, not per-bank browser logins.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAgent SendFeedback is blocked while Privacy Mode is on, so the bot cannot file this for me.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eChat transcript on the Grok Bot app does not match the same chat on my computer — clients are out of sync with no working refresh.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAsk: Restore working Finance/Plaid for Grok Bot (install → live MCP → Plaid Link), and fix multi-client chat sync.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-499603-steps-to-reproduce-3\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-499603-steps-to-reproduce-3\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eSteps to Reproduce\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAnytime I ask it to add a credit card or open up the financing, it cannot open up PLAID to connect my credit cards, and when I try to login to each individual credit card company like Chase or Citi or US Bank or Bank of America ETC, the websites all say they’re erred, so it’s not accepting communication from this bot, which renders this total program useless if I’m unable to connect my finances\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-499603-expected-behavior-4\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-499603-expected-behavior-4\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eExpected Behavior\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFinancing is useless and does not work\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-499603-operating-system-5\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-499603-operating-system-5\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eOperating System\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWindows 10/11\u003cbr\u003e\niOS\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-499603-version-information-6\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-499603-version-information-6\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eVersion Information\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBrock bot\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-499603-additional-information-7\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-499603-additional-information-7\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eAdditional Information\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNone\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-499603-does-this-stop-you-from-using-cursor-8\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-499603-does-this-stop-you-from-using-cursor-8\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDoes this stop you from using Cursor\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eYes - Cursor is unusable\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":1,"post_type":1,"posts_count":2,"updated_at":"2026-09-24T06:56:39.909Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":9,"reads":4,"readers_count":3,"score":45.8,"yours":false,"topic_id":172846,"topic_slug":"plaid-financing-and-connecting-credit-cards","display_username":"Jason L","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":2,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"link_counts":[{"url":"http://cursor.com/marketplace/cursor/finance","internal":false,"reflection":false,"clicks":0},{"url":"https://connectors-gateway.grok.com/gateway/v1/finance/mcp","internal":false,"reflection":false,"clicks":0}],"read":true,"user_title":"","bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":139511,"hidden":false,"trust_level":0,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/plaid-financing-and-connecting-credit-cards/172846/1","reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null,"can_vote":false},{"id":499771,"name":"Dean Rie","username":"deanrie","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.cursor.com/deanrie/{size}/1263_2.png","created_at":"2026-09-24T06:56:07.196Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eHey, thanks for the detailed report. I’ll go through it point by point.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOn Finance/Plaid: This connector isn’t released to users yet, so you can’t install or connect it on your account right now. The listing your bot found, and the “Added finance” message, are part of unreleased work that leaked into the UI. That’s why the Plaid Link window didn’t show up, and the server didn’t start in GetMcpServerStatus. I shared your interest with the team, but I can’t share dates yet.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOn signing in to bank sites: Many banks treat logins coming from the bot’s cloud environment as a new, unknown device and they block or delay the sign-in. That’s where the “temporary delays” on Citi come from. So signing into each bank through the bot browser isn’t a working approach right now.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOn SendFeedback: The tool really is unavailable while Privacy Mode is enabled. That’s expected behavior, nothing is broken. Posting here was the right move.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFor the chat sync issue, I need a bit more info. Please try this:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003col\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOn your computer, open the chat that looks different and send a short message like “sync test”.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOn your iPhone, fully close the Grok Bot app.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOpen the app again and open the same chat.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCheck whether “sync test” and the earlier messages show up.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIf not, send the bot name, the app version on your computer and on your iPhone, and a screenshot of the same chat on both devices. Let me know how it goes.\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":5,"post_type":1,"posts_count":2,"updated_at":"2026-09-24T06:56:07.196Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":0,"reads":2,"readers_count":1,"score":0.4,"yours":false,"topic_id":172846,"topic_slug":"plaid-financing-and-connecting-credit-cards","display_username"